# Copy to .env.local for development, and set the same keys in the Vercel
# project settings for production. Nothing here is required to build — the site
# runs without any of it, forms just log instead of sending.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mapbox — the map on /contact. Public by design; safe in the browser bundle.
# Get one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Resend — delivers the contact, demo and newsletter forms by email.
#
# Without RESEND_API_KEY every submission is written to the server log and
# nothing is sent: the form still says thank you, and the lead is recoverable
# from the log, but no inbox receives it. Set the key to actually deliver.
#
# Key: https://resend.com/api-keys
#
# MAIL_FROM must be an address on a domain verified in Resend
# (https://resend.com/domains). Until plutoxtech.com is verified, leave it unset
# — the code falls back to Resend's sandbox sender, which only delivers to the
# Resend account owner's own address. Good enough to prove the wiring, not good
# enough for customers.
#
# Where submissions go is set in src/lib/site.ts, not here:
#   demo booking → contact.salesEmail   (sales@)
#   enquiry      → contact.email        (hello@)
#   newsletter   → contact.email        (hello@)
#
# NOTE: those addresses only receive mail once plutoxtech.com has MX records
# again — the cPanel mail stack is currently missing from the Cloudflare zone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RESEND_API_KEY=
MAIL_FROM="Plutox Tech <website@plutoxtech.com>"
